<title>CANADA: Agrium plans 5 pct common share buyback.</title>
<headline>Agrium plans 5 pct common share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agrium Inc said on Thursday it intends to purchase up to five percent, or about 3.3 million, of its outstanding common shares beginning September 6, 1996 and ending by September 5, 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier this year Agrium said it completed a similar five percent share purchase program, under which it purchased 3.3 million of its common shares.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
